  "title": "F5 Trailer: Add TLS secrets",
  "description": "The F5 Ethernet trailer can contain TLS secrets. Add a method to\neasily inject these and convert them to DSBs.\n\nCall tls_keylog_process_lines from the F5 Ethernet trailer\npostdissector. Even if the secrets occur after they are needed\n(common with handshake secrets), this still allows selecting\nEdit->Inject TLS Secrets, following by View->Redissect Packets\nto dissect; the file can also be saved as a pcapng file with a\nDSB containing the TLS information from the trailer.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
